                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "385e6acb-2ad2-3149-972f-ecf0e954f6a1",
                        "entry_id": "3499980b-6bc1-3bf8-a123-23ddd812761a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предполагать в мыслях, иметь в виду кого-либо, что-либо, не высказывая этого открыто или говоря иносказательно, намёками"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "97ba9a1f-a5d7-343d-ab4c-8edd058453b6",
                        "entry_id": "3499980b-6bc1-3bf8-a123-23ddd812761a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "вкладывать определённый смысл (в слово, фразу и т. п.), понимать, трактовать что-либо (слово, фразу) определённым образом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1cd3472-812b-4547-b447-ad0f4e13120c",
                                "sense_id": "97ba9a1f-a5d7-343d-ab4c-8edd058453b6",
                                "text": "Процесс обрусения не мог быть единовременным актом, он подразумевал целенаправленное миссионерско-просветительское воздействие на крещеные народы на протяжении длительного времени."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd20c1e8-1904-3894-a026-6cf694545858",
                        "entry_id": "3499980b-6bc1-3bf8-a123-23ddd812761a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предполагать, иметь что-либо своим условием"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1fc6aa55-ed9c-4442-a3c6-909dad096b96",
                        "source_entry_id": "3499980b-6bc1-3bf8-a123-23ddd812761a",
                        "source_sense_description": "иметь в виду",
                        "target_lang_word": "sous-entendre",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sous-entendre",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64898b29-cfa5-339a-a8b8-6042afc6eb5e",
                                        "entry_id": "6b029729-5f11-3282-82e8-9190c31eda45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Laisser entendre une chose sans l’exprimer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d905d9f9-5295-4fb4-966b-955321a31144",
                                                "sense_id": "64898b29-cfa5-339a-a8b8-6042afc6eb5e",
                                                "text": "D'une part, on est volontiers amené à restreindre les cas jugés inopérables puisque l’inopérabilité sous-entend une mort prochaine quasi inéluctable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f6f0d96-e6b1-4ec9-894b-47f0e2e8df0f",
                                                "sense_id": "64898b29-cfa5-339a-a8b8-6042afc6eb5e",
                                                "text": "Quand je vous ai dit cela, j’ai sous-entendu que vous deviez le faire ! — Cette clause, cette condition se sous-entend toujours, elle est réputée exprimée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc073e0d-7b68-4752-a7ef-f997e472bf67",
                                                "sense_id": "64898b29-cfa5-339a-a8b8-6042afc6eb5e",
                                                "text": "Le problème, c’est que la directive pourrait s’étirer jusqu’à la fin janvier, comme le ministre Dubé l’a laissé sous-entendre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7216c383-4ca5-4151-a136-09a253f815bf",
                                                "sense_id": "64898b29-cfa5-339a-a8b8-6042afc6eb5e",
                                                "text": "Il partit d’un rire tonitruant et Morange préféra ignorer ce que le Norvégien sous-entendait, ou même s’il sous-entendait quelque chose."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65d7b025-d462-352b-83df-39f83daeb116",
                                        "entry_id": "6b029729-5f11-3282-82e8-9190c31eda45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certains mots qu’on n’exprime pas et qui peuvent être aisément suppléés."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bce11604-4808-4ffe-abb9-c2652824e01e",
                                                "sense_id": "65d7b025-d462-352b-83df-39f83daeb116",
                                                "text": "Dans cette phrase le verbe est sous-entendu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2ca8105-d6c9-4070-95d5-4608dc9ae249",
                        "source_entry_id": "3499980b-6bc1-3bf8-a123-23ddd812761a",
                        "source_sense_description": "вкладывать определённый смысл",
                        "target_lang_word": "purport",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "purport",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd4dfdd9-f682-36a0-8deb-07a859f7a3a9",
                                        "entry_id": "695a9f4b-9cdf-3abf-9601-30f9804a6a84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To convey, imply, or profess (often falsely or inaccurately)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fdcdaeb-bc0d-4f72-bf75-7b9465882706",
                                                "sense_id": "cd4dfdd9-f682-36a0-8deb-07a859f7a3a9",
                                                "text": "He purports himself to be an international man of affairs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89114eaf-fe63-42d2-8eed-b6d9cc735f22",
                                                "sense_id": "cd4dfdd9-f682-36a0-8deb-07a859f7a3a9",
                                                "text": "The intermediate station seen here, Llanbister Road, is 5 hilly miles by road from the town it purports to serve."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81bf4acc-4be9-36ae-bd08-cd889c11ee20",
                                        "entry_id": "695a9f4b-9cdf-3abf-9601-30f9804a6a84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To intend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b40450e2-14df-4b26-9ea1-7a7f6db8dc64",
                                                "sense_id": "81bf4acc-4be9-36ae-bd08-cd889c11ee20",
                                                "text": "He purported to become an international man of affairs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48126f3a-b6d5-4d5f-86c7-11e81f39b538",
                                                "sense_id": "81bf4acc-4be9-36ae-bd08-cd889c11ee20",
                                                "text": "In all cases, however, although micronations may purport to assert sovereignty in any number of ways, they remain conceptually distinct from recognised sovereign states."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "purport",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8779a997-c2ce-3018-90cc-13af201950cf",
                                        "entry_id": "770a5be3-2412-3515-8cdb-727316d4335a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Import, intention or purpose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc058a3a-464e-4e23-8c33-ffb1f8da4d20",
                                                "sense_id": "8779a997-c2ce-3018-90cc-13af201950cf",
                                                "text": "My practice, you say, refutes my doubts. But you mistake the purport of my question."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6e24058-5656-4487-9a84-adb122d2edc1",
                                                "sense_id": "8779a997-c2ce-3018-90cc-13af201950cf",
                                                "text": "Sorrowful, phantasmal as this same Double Aristocracy of Teachers and Governors now looks, it is worth all men’s while to know that the purport of it is, and remains, noble and most real."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a729f809-6779-47c8-bb0c-417e472ef217",
                                                "sense_id": "8779a997-c2ce-3018-90cc-13af201950cf",
                                                "text": "A child’s brain starts functioning at birth; and has, amongst its many infant convolutions, thousands of dormant atoms, into which God has put a mystic possibility for noticing an adult’s act, and figuring out its purport."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07f5198f-2293-37d4-9222-e8a2d31d9f94",
                                        "entry_id": "770a5be3-2412-3515-8cdb-727316d4335a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A disguise; a covering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78593e9f-f6eb-4abc-9fe1-7b8b87dc073a",
                                                "sense_id": "07f5198f-2293-37d4-9222-e8a2d31d9f94",
                                                "text": "For she her sex under that strange purport / Did use to hide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
